  - m_Id: 14780126544781448
    m_Localized: BATTERY POWER RESTORATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781449
    m_Localized: Collect batteries and fill the power panel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781450
    m_Localized: UNDERCOVER  FIELD MANUAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781451
    m_Localized: BATTERY POWER RESTORATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781452
    m_Localized: '<b>Collect Batteries</b>

      Pick up batteries scattered around
      the field and store them in your inventory.

      Each battery provides a
      different amount of power (W).


      <b>Insert Them into the Power Panel</b>

      Drag
      batteries from storage into the four slots on the power panel.

      The sum
      of the inserted batteries is the power supplied to this device.


      <b>Target
      Power</b>

      The target value is not shown on this screen.

      The agent
      monitoring the HQ gauge will tell you the target.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781453
    m_Localized: POWER LEVER OPERATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781454
    m_Localized: Lower the lever before inserting batteries
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781455
    m_Localized: UNDERCOVER  FIELD MANUAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781456
    m_Localized: POWER LEVER OPERATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781457
    m_Localized: '<b>Cut Power with the Lever</b>

      Power is cut while the lever
      is held down.

      <b>Batteries can only be inserted or removed at this time.</b>


      <b>Raise
      the Lever to Measure</b>

      Release the lever to restore power and begin
      measuring.

      The battery layout cannot be changed while power is flowing.


      <b>Adjust
      Again</b>

      If the value is wrong, lower the lever and adjust the layout.

      The
      repair is complete when the total matches the target.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781458
    m_Localized: POWER GAUGE CHECK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781459
    m_Localized: The target power is at the end of the gauge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781460
    m_Localized: UNDERCOVER  FIELD MANUAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781461
    m_Localized: POWER GAUGE CHECK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781462
    m_Localized: '<b>Read the Gauge</b>

      When the needle reaches the end, the
      power matches the target.

      The target value is hidden, so judge it only
      by the needle position.


      <b>When the Needle Moves</b>

      It rises
      from zero only when the battery operator presses Confirm.

      Lowering the
      lever to cut power returns it to zero.


      <b>Tell the Field Agent</b>

      Power
      too low  replace with a larger battery

      Power too high  remove a battery
      or use a smaller one

      Power matched  confirm the current setup'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781463
    m_Localized: POWER GAUGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781464
    m_Localized: <- TARGET POWER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781465
    m_Localized: Power flows only while the lever is down. Report the needle position
      to the field agent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
