      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14780126544781494
    m_Localized: '<b>Operation</b>

      The knob becomes available after the antenna
      is installed.

      Turn it to the target frequency and hold it there for
      3 seconds to synchronize.


      <b>Change the Control Method</b>

      Use
      the left and right buttons to choose the knob, slider, or roller.

      When
      the coordinate changes, the matching control is selected automatically.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
